        "minutes": 4,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The neck below shows only the crossing from position 1 to position 2 of A Dorian. Climb position 1 from the low {{1}}. On the G string, slide up into position 2 and finish the climb there. Come back down the same way."
