        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The same crossing one position higher: climb position 2, slide up the G string and finish in position 3. Then play both crossings in a row, from the low {{1}} in position 1 to the top of position 3."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "position-neck",
              "scale": "dorian",
              "key": "a",
              "cross": {
